ki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">get_type_hints</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(greet)</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">   # 框架靠这个做校验/文档</span></span></code></pre>",
